This fixture exercises phpc's deterministic placeholder
`mysqli_multi_query()` charset setup boundary after placeholder MySQLi setup.
System PHP needs a real mysqli connection and host multi-result execution
state; phpc only accepts the exact WordPress charset setup statement as a
no-pending-result placeholder and does not model multi-statement execution,
pending result queues, `mysqli_more_results()`/`mysqli_next_result()` state, or
connection charset mutation.
